- `live_monitoring/guardian_replay.py` (writer + reader)
- `live_monitoring/orchestrator/confluence_gate.py` (reader)
- `live_monitoring/orchestrator/unified_monitor.py` (reader)
- `live_monitoring/enrichment/apis/level_watcher.py` (reader)
- `live_monitoring/core/risk_manager.py` (reader)

